# Task 167-007 Execution Plan — T7 Cross-Cutting Synthesis

## Objective
Read T1-T6 reports, identify cross-cutting patterns (same root cause across multiple axes),
produce consolidated inventory + Sprint 168 remediation roadmap.

## Available Inputs
- ✅ T1-code-inventory.md (36950 bytes)
- ❌ T2-doc-inventory.md (MISSING — Wave 1 gap, must flag)
- ✅ T3-adr-compliance.md (46151 bytes)
- ✅ T4-memory-integrity.md (32419 bytes)
- ✅ T5-brain-wire-audit.md (52973 bytes)
- ✅ T6-test-build-security.md (40127 bytes)
- ✅ oss-whitelist.json (4668 bytes)

## Strategy (T2 GAP-aware)
T2 missing — synthesis still proceeds but Sprint 168 roadmap reserves 1 slot for "audit gap closure"
(per spec Section 3.6 Catch-22 fix: "audit gap closure 1 task ile başlangıçta kapatılır").

## Steps
1. Read all 5 available reports (T1, T3, T4, T5, T6)
2. Extract findings tables / severity markers from each
3. Group findings by root cause + cross-cutting axes
4. Generate T7-cross-cutting-synthesis.md (patterns + matrix)
5. Generate consolidated-inventory.md (all findings, severity sorted)
6. Generate sprint-168-roadmap.md (≤12 task, ≤4 critical, 4-field each)
7. Generate T7-predicate.sh (PASS/FAIL gate)
8. Run predicate, verify GO criteria

## Files to Write
- .audit/sprint-167/T7-cross-cutting-synthesis.md
- .audit/sprint-167/consolidated-inventory.md
